<DocsLayout title="Backups" description="Back up a Ravenburst project with Git Backup, on your computer and optionally online, and restore an earlier copy.">
  <h1>Backups</h1>
  <p class="lede">Your project is one file on your computer. A backup keeps dated copies of it somewhere else, so a lost laptop or a bad afternoon of edits isn't the end of the book.</p>

  <nav class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
    <p>On this page</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#choose">Choosing where backups go</a></li>
      <li><a href="#git">Git Backup</a></li>
      <li><a href="#online">Keeping a copy online</a></li>
